est Virginia 82, No. 13 Miami (OH) 54Second roundNo. 5 Kentucky 74, No. 4 West Virginia 73Sweet 16No. 2 Michigan 71, No. 3 Louisville 52 No. 1 Texas 76, No. 5 Kentucky 54Elite EightNo. 2 Michigan vs. No. 1 Texas, 7 p.m. Monday, ESPNRegional 4 −SacramentoSouth Carolina, Columbia, South Carolina | Colonial Life ArenaFirst roundNo. 1 South Carolina 103, No. 16 Southern 34No. 9 USC 71, No. 8 Clemson 67Second roundNo. 1 South Carolina 101, No. 9 USC 61Iowa, Iowa City, Iowa | Carver-Hawkeye ArenaFirst roundNo. 2 Iowa 68, No. 15 FDU 48No. 10 Virginia 82, No. 7 Georgia 73, OTSecond roundNo. 10 Virginia 83, No. 2 Iowa 75 (2OT)TCU, Forth Worth, Texas | Ed and Rae Schollmaier ArenaFirst roundNo. 3 TCU 86, No. 14 UC San Diego 40No. 6 Washington 72, No. 11 South Dakota State 54Second roundNo. 3 TCU 62, No. 6 Washington 59Oklahoma, Norman, Oklahoma | Lloyd Noble CenterFirst roundNo. 4 Oklahoma 89, No. 13 Idaho 59No. 5 Michigan State 65, No. 12 Colorado State 62Second roundNo. 4 Oklahoma 77, No. 5 Michigan State 71Sweet 16No. 1 South Carolina 94, No. 4 Oklahoma 68No. 3 TCU 79, No. 10 Virginia 69Elite EightNo. 1 South Carolina vs. No. 3 TCU, 9 p.m., ESPNThe USA TODAY app gets you to the heart of the news — fast. Download for award-winning coverage, crosswords, audio storytelling, the eNewspaper and more.",
